wal Malabar Hill highly valuable.\n\n⭐ Why This Project Stands Out\n• 👑 Only 14 Exclusive Residences\n• 📍 Prestigious Malabar Hill Address\n• 🌊 270° Arabian Sea Views\n• 🏗 Architecture by Broadway Malyan\n• 🏙 Rare South Mumbai Redevelopment Project\n• 💼 Designed for HNIs & UHNIs\n\n📝 Booking & Enquiry Process\nDuring Site Visit:\n\n1️⃣ Detailed Project Presentation\n2️⃣ Residence Pricing & Payment Plan Discussion\n3️⃣ Layout & Sea View Orientation\n4️⃣ Booking & Documentation Assistance\n⚠️ Limited inventory available.","score":0.9256635417337614,"raw_content":null,"id":"09c96d-01"},{"url":"https://propertybutler.in/insights/sambhav-primordial-house-malabar-hill-review-2026","title":"Sambhav Primordial House — Malabar Hill Building Review 2026: Price, Verdict and Who It's For | Property Butler","content":"## Frequently Asked Questions\n\nThe committed possession date is available on the RERA portal under registration P51900010963. Property Butler advises verifying this directly on maharera.mahaonline.gov.in rather than relying on marketing materials. Small developers on Malabar Hill have historically taken 12–24 months beyond the RERA date to complete projects — factor this into your decision if you need possession by a specific date. [...] The project’s RERA registration P51900010963 is verifiable on the Maharashtra RERA portal (maharera.mahaonline.gov.in). Property Butler advises all buyers to verify: (1) RERA-committed possession date; (2) current construction stage versus RERA milestone schedule; (3) whether the developer has drawn any funds from the RERA escrow account beyond permitted stages. Small boutique developers on Malabar Hill have a mixed track record on construction pace — a completed, OC-received unit is worth a significant premium over an under-construction unit from the same developer.\n\n## The 57.7% PSF Discount vs Aurum Girnar — What It Means [...] | Parameter | Sambhav Primordial House | Aurum Girnar | Satellite Sesen |\n ---  --- |\n| Develope